1. Verify Installation
node -v
npm -v
git --version
code --version
2. Install Node.js (LTS)

Download:

Node.js LTS: https://nodejs.org/

Verify:

node -v
npm -v
3. Install Git

Download:

Git for Windows: https://git-scm.com/downloads

Verify:

git --version
4. Install Visual Studio Code

Download:

VS Code: https://code.visualstudio.com/

Verify:

code --version

If code is not recognized, open VS Code and press Ctrl+Shift+P, then run:

Shell Command: Install 'code' command in PATH
5. Create Vite Project
npm create vite@latest workforce-analytics-dashboard -- --template react-ts

Go to project

cd workforce-analytics-dashboard
6. Install All Required Packages
React Router
npm install react-router-dom
Redux Toolkit
npm install @reduxjs/toolkit react-redux
React Query
npm install @tanstack/react-query
Axios
npm install axios
Tailwind CSS (Latest)
npm install tailwindcss @tailwindcss/vite
Charts
npm install recharts
Icons
npm install react-icons
Forms
npm install react-hook-form
Validation
npm install zod @hookform/resolvers
Table
npm install @tanstack/react-table
CSV Export
npm install papaparse
Date Handling
npm install date-fns
Debounce
npm install lodash
npm install -D @types/lodash
Theme Support
npm install next-themes
Notifications
npm install react-hot-toast
Loading Spinner
npm install react-loader-spinner
Class Names
npm install clsx
UUID
npm install uuid
npm install -D @types/uuid
Environment Variables
npm install dotenv
7. Testing
Vitest
npm install -D vitest
React Testing Library
npm install -D @testing-library/react @testing-library/jest-dom @testing-library/user-event
Mock Service Worker
npm install -D msw
jsdom
npm install -D jsdom
8. Linting
npm install -D eslint
TypeScript ESLint
npm install -D @typescript-eslint/parser @typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin
React ESLint
npm install -D eslint-plugin-react eslint-plugin-react-hooks eslint-plugin-react-refresh
Prettier
npm install -D prettier eslint-config-prettier eslint-plugin-prettier
9. Git Hooks
npm install -D husky lint-staged

Initialize Husky:

npx husky init
10. Install All VS Code Extensions
ESLint
Prettier
Tailwind CSS IntelliSense
GitLens
Auto Rename Tag
Path Intellisense
Error Lens
Material Icon Theme
Thunder Client
GitHub Pull Requests
11. Run the Project
npm run dev
12. Build
npm run build
13. Lint
npm run lint
14. Run Tests
npm test

or, if you're using Vitest directly:

npm run test
Final Tech Stack
Framework: React 19 + TypeScript + Vite
Routing: React Router DOM
State Management: Redux Toolkit
Server State: TanStack React Query
Styling: Tailwind CSS
Charts: Recharts
Forms: React Hook Form
Validation: Zod
HTTP Client: Axios
Tables: TanStack React Table
CSV Export: PapaParse
Date Utilities: date-fns
Notifications: React Hot Toast
Icons: React Icons
Utilities: Lodash, clsx, uuid
Testing: Vitest, React Testing Library, MSW
Code Quality: ESLint, Prettier, Husky, lint-staged
